== Phase 3: Secure Escrow Payment & Webhook Verification ==

opt #EFF6FF Paid Mentoring Session (amount > 0)
    CLIENT -> PAY_SVC : POST /api/payment/booking/:bookingId\n{paymentMethod: 'VNPAY'}
    activate PAY_SVC
    
