title <size:18><b>EDUMAP PLATFORM - GIS CRAWLER & VECTOR INGESTION PIPELINE</b></size>\n<size:12>Activity & Data Flow Pipeline (Multi-Source Crawling, PostGIS Spatial Geocoding & ChromaDB RAG Vector Store)</size>

start

partition "<b>Stage 1: Multi-Source Data Collection (crawlers/)</b>" #F8FAFC {
  :<b>Trigger Batch / Scheduled Crawl</b>\n(Python 3.11 / Crontab / BullMQ Worker);
  
  fork
    :<b>OSM Overpass Crawler</b> (overpass_crawler.py)\n- Mirror rotation & rate limit (3s delay)\n- Query schools, universities, amenities;
  fork again
    :<b>Đồng Nai Education Portal</b> (dongnai_schools_crawler.py)\n- Sở GD&ĐT Đồng Nai & DNTU portal\n- High schools, colleges, vocational centers;
