    :<b>PostGIS Spatial Geocoding</b>\n- Generate Point geometry:\n  <b>ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(lng, lat), 4326)::geography</b>\n- Split SQL into 30,000-line chunks (consolidated_crawled_data_*.sql);
    
    :<b>Database Seeding & Spatial Indexing</b>\n- Bulk insert into tables: <b>map_points</b>, <b>schools</b>, <b>wifi_locations</b>\n- Build GiST index: <b>CREATE INDEX USING GIST(location)</b>;
    
    :<b>NestJS Spatial API Engine (backend/)</b>\n- <b>ST_DWithin</b> Radius Search (< 5km distance)\n- K-Nearest Neighbor (KNN: <b><-></b>)\n- GeoJSON serialization & dynamic clustering;
    
    :<b>Client GIS Applications</b>\n- <b>Mobile App (mobile/):</b> Expo SDK 50 MapScreen & Nearby POIs\n- <b>Web Portal (frontend/):</b> Leaflet / MapLibre interactive map;
