    :<b>ChromaDB Persistent Vector Store</b>\n- Upsert vectors & metadata into collections:\n  ['edumap_knowledge', 'facilities', 'scholarships']\n- Persist to volume (/data/chromadb);
    
    :<b>FastAPI RAG Retriever & Gemini LLM (ai-service/)</b>\n- Vector cosine similarity search (top_k = 3)\n- Context injection into Gemini 1.5 Flash Prompt;
    
